# Autonomous GUI QA Rule

When modifying mobile UI components (SwiftUI / UIKit / Jetpack Compose / Flutter):
1. Use `autonomous_gui_qa` MCP tools or CLI to verify screen rendering and state transitions.
2. If visual defects (text truncation, overlapping, contrast issues) are detected, inspect the annotated screenshot and patch the corresponding View code.
3. Verify changes with compile check and regression scenario re-run.
